  "name": "Danger Sense",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/orb-crystal-ball-scrying.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, you gain an uncanny sense of when things nearby aren't as they should be, allowing you to react to any source of danger.</p>\n<p>You have advantage on Dexterity saving throws against effects that you can see, such as traps and creations. To gain this benefit, you can't be blinded, deafened, or incapacitated.</p>\n<p>In addition, while raging, if you see a creature within 5 ft of you get hit by an attack, you can use your reaction to become the target of that attack instead.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
